A: matched pair beats >=95% of mismatched theory energies in only 1/11 (phase) and 0/11 (magnitude) cases.
A: a high matched-pair correlation is therefore NOT by itself evidence of energy-matched agreement;
   the panels share a common angular baseline that all energies reproduce.

